---
import Caveat from '../components/Caveat.astro';
import DocPage from '../components/DocPage.astro';
import { REMOVAL_FORM, REPO } from '../lib/catalog';
---

<DocPage
  title="These prices will not be 100% accurate"
  lede="Voice Prices is an unofficial, best-effort reference. Treat every number on this site as an estimate, not as a bill."
  path="/disclaimer/"
  caveat={false}
>
  <Caveat variant="full" />
  <p>
    This project is a best effort by its maintainers and community to give an indicative estimate of what you might pay to
    call a voice or LLM API. Providers do not publish their prices in a form that can be read reliably by a machine, so the
    rates here are read off public pricing pages by hand, and some are converted from the vendor's unit into the one this
    catalog uses. A conversion is not a quote.
  </p>
  <p>
    Voice Prices is <strong>unofficial</strong>. It is not published by, affiliated with, or endorsed by any vendor listed
    here, and vendor names are used only to identify whose rates a row describes. All trademarks belong to their owners.
  </p>
  <h2>Before you rely on a number</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Open the source link on the row and confirm the rate on the vendor's own page.</li>
    <li>Check the date it was last confirmed, and whether it is marked stale or estimated.</li>
    <li>Remember your own rate may differ with your plan, region, commitment, voice, or negotiated terms.</li>
    <li>The cost-per-minute calculator multiplies these rates by assumptions about a typical call. A real call can cost more or less.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is financial, legal or purchasing advice. Everything is provided as-is, with no warranty of any
    kind, under the <a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/LICENSE`} rel="noopener">LICENSE</a>. If you get a bill you did not expect,
    the vendor's invoice is the source of truth, not this site.
  </p>
  <h2>For vendors</h2>
  <p>
    If a row about your product is wrong, or you want it removed, <a href={REMOVAL_FORM} rel="noopener">fill in this short
    form</a> and we will correct or remove it within 24 hours. No lawyer, no takedown notice, no argument.
  </p>
  <h2>Disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    Voice Prices is maintained alongside a voice infrastructure product (VoiceGateway). The dataset is open, the sources are
    cited, and it publishes its maintainer's own markups on the same terms as everyone else's.
  </p>
</DocPage>
